# T119 (story 4): remove app-01 (it has a data folder): the data stays; deleting it takes two confirmations, and declining the second keeps it.
# scenario demo
# expect-no-file applications/app-01.bin
# expect-file system/app-01/notes.db
size 1404 1872
wait 400
tap refresh
waitfor catalogLine Catalog last updated
tap appRow 0
waitfor detailState Installed
tap actionRemove
waitfor planSummary Remove App app-01
tap confirm
waitfor resultText
expect resultText App app-01 was removed
expect resultText Its data was kept in system/app-01
shot @OUT@/40-remove-result.png
tap askDelete
waitfor deletePrompt Delete the data of this app?
expect deletePrompt system/app-01
tap deleteData
waitfor deletePrompt
shot @OUT@/41-delete-second.png
expect deletePrompt files
tap keepData
waitfor appRow
quit
